{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理基础模型：从 patch encoder 到 whole-slide 多模态推理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pathology Foundations</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_041_prov_gigapath-title\">Prov-GigaPath</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">DINOv2 病理 tile encoder 与 LongNet 膨胀注意力 slide encoder 两级串联，并以 masked tile reconstruction 预训练全切片上下文。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Two-stage gigapixel pathology foundation model pairing a DINOv2 tile encoder with a LongNet dilated-attention whole-slide encoder pretrained via masked tile reconstruction.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">全视野病理切片及其组织 tile 坐标序列</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Whole-slide image (WSI) decomposed into tens of thousands of tissue tiles with 2D spatial (x, y) coordinates</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">整张 WSI 的长上下文表征与病例级任务预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Contextualized whole-slide representation and patient/case-level diagnostic or genomic predictions</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-07441-w\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Prov-GigaPath original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/791888436d5b65d56de9.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">全视野切片</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Whole-Slide Image (WSI)</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">真实临床流程产生的 gigapixel WSI，单图远超普通视觉模型输入范围。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests whole-slide image (wsi) decomposed into tens of thousands of tissue tiles with 2d spatial (x, y) coordinates and prepares initial tensor representations (Whole-Slide Image (WSI)).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"真实临床流程产生的 gigapixel WSI，单图远超普通视觉模型输入范围。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests whole-slide image (wsi) decomposed into tens of thousands of tissue tiles with 2d spatial (x, y) coordinates and prepares initial tensor representations (Whole-Slide Image (WSI)).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"全视野切片\" data-node-name-en=\"Whole-Slide Image (WSI)\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全视野切片</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Whole-Slide Image (WSI)</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">真实临床流程产生的 gigapixel WSI，单图远超普通视觉模型输入范围。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests whole-slide image (wsi) decomposed into tens of thousands of tissue tiles with 2d spatial (x, y) coordinates and prepares initial tensor representations (Whole-Slide Image (WSI)).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"检测组织区并提取大量定尺度 tile，同时保留其二维坐标。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Tiling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"组织 Tiling\" data-node-name-en=\"Tiling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">组织 Tiling</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tiling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">检测组织区并提取大量定尺度 tile，同时保留其二维坐标。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Tiling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"第一阶段在约 13 亿病理 tiles 上自监督训练 ViT，逐 tile 输出形态向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DINOv2 Tile Encoder within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"DINOv2 Tile Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"DINOv2 Tile Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>DINOv2 Tile Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">第一阶段在约 13 亿病理 tiles 上自监督训练 ViT，逐 tile 输出形态向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DINOv2 Tile Encoder within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"一张 WSI 的 tile embeddings 按空间位置组成超长序列。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Tile sequence + within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Tile 序列 + 坐标\" data-node-name-en=\"Tile sequence +\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Tile 序列 + 坐标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tile sequence +</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">一张 WSI 的 tile embeddings 按空间位置组成超长序列。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Tile sequence + within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"slide 预训练时遮蔽部分 tile embeddings，要求模型利用跨区域上下文恢复。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Masked Tile input within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Masked Tile 输入\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked Tile input\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Masked Tile 输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Masked Tile input</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">slide 预训练时遮蔽部分 tile embeddings，要求模型利用跨区域上下文恢复。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Masked Tile input within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"膨胀注意力以稀疏、多尺度连接覆盖数万 tile，避免全局 N² attention。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs LongNet Slide Encoder within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"LongNet Slide Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"LongNet Slide Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>LongNet Slide Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">膨胀注意力以稀疏、多尺度连接覆盖数万 tile，避免全局 N² attention。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs LongNet Slide Encoder within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由上下文预测被遮 tile 表征，训练 whole-slide 级关系建模。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Slide MAE objective within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Slide MAE 目标\" data-node-name-en=\"Slide MAE objective\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Slide MAE 目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Slide MAE objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由上下文预测被遮 tile 表征，训练 whole-slide 级关系建模。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Slide MAE objective within the core two level tile and long context slide encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"聚合后的长上下文表示包含跨区域组织结构与病灶异质性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies WSI Embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"WSI Embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"WSI Embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>WSI Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">聚合后的长上下文表示包含跨区域组织结构与病灶异质性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies WSI Embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"接分类、检索、分型或预后任务头进行少量适配。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces contextualized whole-slide representation and patient/case-level diagnostic or genomic predictions via Head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"病例级 Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_041_prov_gigapath', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">病例级 Head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">接分类、检索、分型或预后任务头进行少量适配。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces contextualized whole-slide representation and patient/case-level diagnostic or genomic predictions via Head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Prov-GigaPath Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Prov-GigaPath 在超长 tile 序列上重建被遮表征</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Masked Tile Embedding Reconstruction Across Tens of Thousands of WSI Coordinates via LongNet</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Prov-GigaPath：核心公式 · Prov-GigaPath 在超长 tile 序列上重建被遮表征\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"41\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.655756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -68.996029 214.705882 25.655756\" width=\"214.705882pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m041_g8-0\"></path><path d=\"M3.506851-.057964V-.420242H2.130194C1.478094-.420242 .840485-.956414 .753538-1.68097H3.383676V-2.043248H.753538C.833239-2.731576 1.405639-3.303975 2.130194-3.303975H3.506851V-3.666253H2.159177C1.152044-3.666253 .376769-2.825768 .376769-1.862109S1.152044-.057964 2.159177-.057964H3.506851Z\" id=\"m041_g8-50\"></path><path d=\"M5.376205-.485452L5.339977-.557908C5.028418-.217367 4.571948 0 4.108232 0C3.318466 0 2.557682-.239103 1.804144-.434734C2.59391-1.137553 3.043135-1.934564 3.217028-2.977925C3.303975-3.521342 3.383676-4.753087 4.14446-4.753087C4.463265-4.753087 4.738596-4.637158 4.738596-4.27488C4.738596-4.129969 4.66614-3.992303 4.564702-3.890865V-3.8111